  <data name="how_title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Simple, Fast, Transparent&lt;br/&gt;Supply Chain Flow</value></data>
  <data name="how_sub" xml:space="preserve"><value>From harvest to delivery — every step is tracked, verified, and transparent. Ek hi platform, poora supply chain.</value></data>
  <data name="step1_title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Farmer Lists Produce</value></data>
  <data name="step1_desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Farmers upload crop details, quantities &amp; harvest dates via web dashboard. AI predicts best price.</value></data>
  <data name="step2_title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Warehouse Verification</value></data>
  <data name="step2_desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Farmers deliver produce to the nearest warehouse. Field Officers verify quality and generate digital grading reports on-site.</value></data>
  <data name="step3_title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Vendor Places Order</value></data>
  <data name="step3_desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Vendors browse the live catalog, add to cart, and place bulk purchase orders with transparent pricing.</value></data>
  <data name="step4_title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Deliver &amp; Pay</value></data>
  <data name="step4_desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Logistics picks up, real-time tracking begins. Payment is auto-released to platform upon delivery confirmation.</value></data>
