  <data name="why_badge" xml:space="preserve"><value>Why Choose Us</value></data>
  <data name="why_title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Why FarmBridge?&lt;br/&gt;Because Farmers Deserve Better</value></data>
  <data name="why_sub" xml:space="preserve"><value>India's 140 million farming families deserve a platform built for them — transparent, accessible, and fair.</value></data>
  <data name="why1_title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Centralized Procurement</value></data>
  <data name="why1_desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>One unified platform for farmers, vendors, and field officers. Streamlined ordering, quality checks, and payments — all managed centrally for maximum efficiency.</value></data>
  <data name="why1_highlight" xml:space="preserve"><value>1 Platform</value></data>
  <data name="why2_title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Quality Guaranteed</value></data>
  <data name="why2_desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Every batch is physically inspected by a certified Field Officer before payment is released. No compromise on quality.</value></data>
  <data name="why2_highlight" xml:space="preserve"><value>100% Verified</value></data>
  <data name="why3_title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Gov. Scheme Discovery</value></data>
  <data name="why3_desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Easy discovery and guided application assistance for local government farming subsidies, grants, and financial aid.</value></data>
  <data name="why3_highlight" xml:space="preserve"><value>Subsidies</value></data>
  <data name="why4_title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Transparent Payments</value></data>
  <data name="why4_desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Automated payment triggers. Farmers get paid directly upon verified delivery. Full payment history visible anytime.</value></data>
  <data name="why4_highlight" xml:space="preserve"><value>Auto-Payments</value></data>
  <data name="why5_title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Smart Notifications</value></data>
  <data name="why5_desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>System-wide alerts for every milestone — order placed, quality approved, shipment picked up, payment released. Stay informed always.</value></data>
  <data name="why5_highlight" xml:space="preserve"><value>Always Informed</value></data>
  <data name="why6_title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Mobile-First Access</value></data>
  <data name="why6_desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Designed for the field. Farmers and vendors can manage everything from their smartphones — simple, fast, and accessible anywhere.</value></data>
  <data name="why6_highlight" xml:space="preserve"><value>Simple &amp; Fast</value></data>
